WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.110
Thank you for your interest in Nucleus
Medical Media

00:00:03.110 --> 00:00:06.629
we hope you enjoy this video explaining
our production process.

00:00:06.629 --> 00:00:12.609
Our animation team produces a creative
brief for you based on your initial proposal.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:16.330
This brief includes the goals of your
project, the intended audience,

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:20.320
style, and what to expect from the final
deliverable.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:24.230
Our writers work with you to create a
script to the action in your video.

00:00:24.230 --> 00:00:29.579
This script includes narration if you
want it. Before the script is finalized,

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:34.359
you will have the opportunity to review
the script for accuracy and visual flow.

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:39.350
Next we use the script to build models
for your animation and create a storyboard.

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:42.370
At this step we'll point out key frames

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:45.420
to describe our concept of what's happening in the animation,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:49.600
and what the narrator is saying at each
point. You will get another chance to

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:52.000
review it to make sure we're on the
right track.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:55.269
We will advise you to check for items
such as accuracy,

00:00:55.269 --> 00:00:58.479
object placement, general textures, and
camera angles.

00:00:58.479 --> 00:01:01.839
From there we create what's called an
animatic.

00:01:01.839 --> 00:01:05.059
This is a rough draft to the animation
that we provide to clients

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.840
as one more review step before the final product.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:10.960
Watch your animatic for details such as:

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:16.120
how objects move, timing, transitions, camera motion, and narration quality.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:19.530
Note the colors will not be as vibrant
as the final animation.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:23.910
When you're happy with your animatic
we'll move on to the final animation.

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:27.670
Our animators enhance your animation
with elaborate textures,

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:32.860
lighting, and special effects, creating an
animation that exceeds your expectations.

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:37.080
When your animation is finished you'll
take a final look to make sure it's

00:01:37.080 --> 00:01:41.780
everything you wanted and more. Our post-production team adds your logos,

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.870
and delivers the animation in the file
format you need.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.850
You have complete control of this fun,
creative process.

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:52.710
If you're interested in working with
Nucleus, please contact us using our

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:53.800
toll-free number

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:55.160
or visit our website.

